WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.998
Every AI vendor says the same thing: trust me, it works. In production, trust is not a strategy. A number is.

00:06.998 --> 00:16.508
I build the proof layer that sits under everything: real evaluations, real tests, and gates wired into your pipeline — the harness that keeps your AI honest.

00:16.508 --> 00:28.664
The hard part is drift. Models change, data changes, and quality rots quietly. So I build regression detection that turns a silent failure into a red build, before your customer finds it.

00:28.664 --> 00:37.430
This is the difference: every build ships with evidence. Tests passing, coverage, gates green, drift caught — a number you can see, not a promise.

00:37.430 --> 00:41.453
Stop shipping on faith. Ship with proof. Let's build your gate.

